    tree=this working tree with the dependency installed, gate with this change
        Ran 22 tests in 1.567s
        OK
        check-evidence-commands: 334 files, 1352 command lines, 1 interpreter mismatch(es), 5 dangling path(s), 6 recorded; every command line can run and every absence is recorded and live
